# Capture output. Regenerated on every run and specific to whichever layer was
# rendered, so it is never meaningful history — and under the authoring blindfold
# the agent cannot read images inside the repo anyway. Point the harness outside
# the tree instead:  OUTDIR=<scratchpad>/shots ./capture-states.sh
shots/
index.html

# Layout-audit output: one <state>.png beside one <state>.layout.json per skin.
# The reports are measurements of a specific build on a specific display, so
# they are worth reading and never worth committing. `waivers.json` is the part
# that belongs in history.
audit/

# Compiled renderer and its build log.
.render
.render.log

# Compiled window-id helper, built on demand from test-cases/capture-dialog.swift.
.findwin

# Parked snooze state, restored by the harness on exit. Present only mid-run.
.settings.backup.json
